# GridSentry — Environment Variables
# This project is entirely client-side and requires NO API keys.
# Open-Meteo weather API is free and keyless.
# Copy this file to .env if you need to override any Vite variables.

# Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.
# Example (not required for GridSentry):
# VITE_APP_TITLE=GridSentry

# No secrets required — do NOT add any real API keys here.
